[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 32236.628, "timestamp": "08:57:16", "text": "如果你有轉換器，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32242.23, "timestamp": "08:57:22", "text": "像是那種行動電源上的充電極之間的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 32242.473, "timestamp": "08:57:22", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hey hey guys how's it going?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32245.51, "timestamp": "08:57:25", "text": "轉換器，那也許可以。  不太確定。我從來沒試過那些東西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32253.19, "timestamp": "08:57:33", "text": "就像我一開始沒有筆記型電腦一樣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32255.83, "timestamp": "08:57:35", "text": "所以，如果我突然沉默了，請不要介意"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32271.83, "timestamp": "08:57:51", "text": "。我剛才說了我會閉上眼睛想像事物。然後我就說：「是啊，沒關係，沒關係，沒關係。」我會先在腦海中想像一些畫面，然後慢慢地睡著。  那很糟糕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 32277.59, "timestamp": "08:57:57", "text": "我想是"}]